    "detailed_description": "<i><strong>(This game, as well as many others in our bundle, is FANTASTIC for Youtubers &amp; Streamers to create content and engage with their audience. This creates a unique experience for all parties involved, and players playing the game themselves can enjoy the solo experience tremendously all on their own as well!)</strong></i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Familiar Friends</u></strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030260/extras/f55a71dc2a62019d7d3e6ef82140a3d2.avif?t=1731347742\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span><br><br><br><strong><u>Familiar Friends</u> can be described as a relaxing, companion-finder simulation.<br>A cute and cozy Visual Novel experience with plenty of choices to make, you'll  answer a plethora of informative questions to find a Familiar truly meant for you!<br>Come meet a colorful cast of quirky companions as you enter The Conjuring Chamber and make new friends;<br>All to a relaxing and invigorating Original Soundtrack.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030260/extras/f193e42a8cecdc9276809f57121f376f.avif?t=1731347742\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Player - Developer interaction.<br></li><li> An opportunity to be selected to choose the name of a character for future episodes as a token of our gratitude for your support.<br></li><li> An atmospheric, cozy experience that's short enough to complete in one sitting.<br></li><li> Wonderful Soundtrack by A Beautiful Collection of Darkness<br></li><li> A Multitude of endings based on your answers and choices.<br></li><li> FREE! \u2665 (I mean, why not, right?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030260/extras/6e7f9847cf0fdc3ac10c4751325bf57d.avif?t=1731347742\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></li></ul></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<i><strong>(This game, as well as many others in our bundle, is FANTASTIC for Youtubers &amp; Streamers to create content and engage with their audience. This creates a unique experience for all parties involved, and players playing the game themselves can enjoy the solo experience tremendously all on their own as well!)</strong></i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Familiar Friends</u></strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030260/extras/f55a71dc2a62019d7d3e6ef82140a3d2.avif?t=1731347742\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span><br><br><br><strong><u>Familiar Friends</u> can be described as a relaxing, companion-finder simulation.<br>A cute and cozy Visual Novel experience with plenty of choices to make, you'll  answer a plethora of informative questions to find a Familiar truly meant for you!<br>Come meet a colorful cast of quirky companions as you enter The Conjuring Chamber and make new friends;<br>All to a relaxing and invigorating Original Soundtrack.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030260/extras/f193e42a8cecdc9276809f57121f376f.avif?t=1731347742\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Player - Developer interaction.<br></li><li> An opportunity to be selected to choose the name of a character for future episodes as a token of our gratitude for your support.<br></li><li> An atmospheric, cozy experience that's short enough to complete in one sitting.<br></li><li> Wonderful Soundtrack by A Beautiful Collection of Darkness<br></li><li> A Multitude of endings based on your answers and choices.<br></li><li> FREE! \u2665 (I mean, why not, right?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030260/extras/6e7f9847cf0fdc3ac10c4751325bf57d.avif?t=1731347742\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></li></ul></strong>",
    "short_description": "A cute and cozy Visual Novel experience with plenty of choices to make! Come find the Familiar truly meant for you by feeding The Conjuring Cauldron with a multitude of choices, all to a relaxing Original Soundtrack!",
